# Candidate agent-story bundles are UNREVIEWED extracts of real agent session
# transcripts. docs/PLAN.md states this is a public project, so committing one
# would publish the owner's own prompts and tool output permanently, before any
# editorial review. Generate them locally with scripts/series/redact_agent_story.py,
# review, and publish only what the owner has explicitly approved.
artifacts/series/**/*.candidate.json
